 "sentences": [
  "Pompeii's walls are covered in 2,000-year-old graffiti, and some of it is very rude.",
  "Scholars have catalogued more than eleven thousand inscriptions from the city.",
  "In the Basilica, one reads: Samius to Cornelius, go hang yourself.",
  "Others are love notes, greetings and boasts.",
  "One line turns up in several places: O wall, I'm amazed you haven't collapsed under all this scribbling.",
  "Even Romans were tired of graffiti.",
  "Follow for more from Pompeii."
